-- Reg 18(4). A late choice (1 July, after the period ended on 31 May) of a pension, which the Secretary of State thinks reasonable and no lump sum was paid.
#ASSERT `What am I paid after my choice` TRUE `a state pension` `in writing` TRUE FALSE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `a state pension under regulation 20`
-- A late choice with a lump sum paid and repaid in full and in currency.
