-- A late choice the Secretary of State does not think reasonable: the person has failed to choose within the period, so reg 18(5).
#ASSERT `What am I paid after my choice` TRUE `a state pension` `in writing` TRUE FALSE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 7 2026) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `a lump sum under regulation 19`
-- A late choice but the lump sum paid was not repaid in full.
