-- Reg 22 and the percentage in reg 10: one-ninth of 1 per cent of 900.
#ASSERT `How much does each whole week of that part of my deferral add to my weekly pension` 900 EQUALS 1
-- One-ninth of 1 per cent of 450.
#ASSERT `How much does each whole week of that part of my deferral add to my weekly pension` 450 EQUALS 0.5
-- Lines 298-307: reg 23 and fork F20. Read literally, the adjustment in paragraph (5) is nil, so the increment is the one regulation 22 gives. Asserted as a finding.
#ASSERT `How much does each whole week add to my weekly pension where regulations 12A and 22 both apply` 900 EQUALS 1

